        "contentXml": "<caml:Content xmlns:caml=\"http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#\"><p>Every public officer who, under color of authority, without lawful necessity, assaults or beats any person, is punishable by a fine not exceeding ten thousand dollars ($10,000), or by imprisonment in a county jail not exceeding one year, or pursuant to subdivision (h) of Section 1170, or by both that fine and imprisonment.</p></caml:Content>",
